{"title":"The election","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/972328601/0/marginalrevolution~The-election.html","date":1793778085000,"content":"<p>Procedurally it seems to have gone just fine, and the people predicting “the end of democracy in America” now look foolish.  They have been suffering under fundamental misunderstandings of <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/fahadmh/status/2117883505338446098\" target=\"_blank\">how this country works</a>.  During this election cycle, democracy never was under threat and the United States has not been under risk of fascism.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Rising in status</strong>:</p>\r\n<p>Matt Yglesias (socially moderate Democrats did very well)</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/GarettJones/status/2117846497752653830\" target=\"_blank\">Normie social science results on campaign finance</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/StatisticUrban/status/2117830787664150734\" target=\"_blank\">Nate Silver predictions</a></p>\r\n<p><strong>Falling in status</strong>:</p>\r\n<p>Tariffs</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/adamkovac/status/2117815203391771046\" target=\"_blank\">Corruption</a></p>\r\n<p>War with Iran</p>\r\n<p>Wealth taxes (losing in CA)</p>\r\n<p>Gerrymandering (came back to hurt Republicans, given the Blue wave)</p>\r\n<p>And there you go.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/the-election.html\">The election</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/972328601/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/9723286